IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-STREAMING-KV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SINK-SIZE           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 WINDOW-SIZE         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 HIT-RATE-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-STREAM-KV.
    MOVE 99 TO HIT-RATE-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SINK-SIZE.
    WEIGHT 30 HIT-RATE-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
